eme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">A three ring man.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d8/A_three_ring_man..png/revision/latest?cb=20240531170611\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"A three ring man.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d8/A_three_ring_man..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240531170611\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d8/A_three_ring_man..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240531170611 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d8/A_three_ring_man..png/revision/latest?cb=20240531170611 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"A three ring man.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"A_three_ring_man..png\" data-image-name=\"A three ring man..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_17\" title=\"Series 17\">17</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Joanne_McNally\" title=\"Joanne McNally\">Joanne McNally</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Snooker_cue_umbrella_chin.\" title=\"Snooker cue umbrella chin.\">Snooker cue umbrella chin.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dream_date_territory.\" title=\"Dream date territory.\">Dream date territory.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>A three ring man.</b></i> is the sixth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_17\" title=\"Series 17\">Series 17</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 2 May 2024. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Joanne_McNally\" title=\"Joanne McNally\">Joanne McNally</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_three_ring_man.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> describes <a href=\"/wiki/Nick_Mohammed\" title=\"Nick Mohammed\">Nick Mohammed</a> as \"a three-ring man\" at the start of the <a href=\"/wiki/Completely_cover_your_teammate_in_rubber_rings\" title=\"Completely cover your teammate in rubber rings\">Completely cover your teammate in rubber rings</a> task, suggesting that, based on Nick’s diminutive stature, <a href=\"/wiki/Steve_Pemberton\" title=\"Steve Pemberton\">Steve Pemberton</a> will only need to land three of the inflatable rings on target to completely conceal him. The title card is a close-up of a thumb, which references the <a href=\"/wiki/Have_the_most_exciting_thumb_war_with_Alex\" title=\"Have the most exciting thumb war with Alex\">Have the most exciting thumb war with Alex</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_three_ring_man.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Kolmen renkaan mies', which translates as 'Three tyre man'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_three_ring_man.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Joanne_McNally\" title=\"Joanne McNally\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Joanne McNally</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/John_Robins\" title=\"John Robins\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">John Robins</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Nick_Mohammed\" title=\"Nick Mohammed\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Nick Mohammed</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sophie_Willan\" title=\"Sophie Willan\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sophie Willan</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Steve_Pemberton\" title=\"Steve Pemberton\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Steve Pemberton</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_thing_that_you_can_get_into\" title=\"Best thing that you can get into\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best thing that you can get into.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>2a\n</td>\n<td>Make a bespoke personal hamper for [the contestant before you in the alphabet].\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Have_the_most_exciting_thumb_war_with_Alex\" title=\"Have the most exciting thumb war with Alex\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Have the most exciting thumb war with Alex.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_most_moves_on_the_movement_circles\" title=\"Make the most moves on the movement circles\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Make the most moves on the movement circles. Your teammate must flip a bottle, then throw a dart at each dartboard to create a move. If they get a bulls-eye, you have free choice. Also, if they successfully land the bottle flip, your teammate may place a dart anywhere in the dartboard.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Create_a_picture_of_the_person_who_gave_you_this_hamper_using_its_contents\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Create a picture of the person who gave you this hamper using its contents\">2b</a>\n</td>\n<td>Create a picture of the person who gave you this hamper using the contents of this hamper.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Completely_cover_your_teammate_in_rubber_rings\" title=\"Completely cover your teammate in rubber rings\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team Live:</b> Completely cover your teammate in rubber rings. Catchers must face the Taskmaster at all times with their hands above their head. Throwers must stay behind the white line.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">20\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td>19\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_three_ring_man.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is the first episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_17\" title=\"Series 17\">Series 17</a> not won by <a href=\"/wiki/Steve_Pemberton\" title=\"Steve Pemberton\">Steve Pemberton</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/John_Robins\" title=\"John Robins\">John Robins</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_